    "hash": "c780e8ea69d4eb771dbc7e1db824b64bc15f45f4e7173ce41a5c0e4757d1f37b",
    "summary_one_sentence": "MMA legend Patton James leaves his commercial fishing life behind to enter the cage for one final ONE Championship bout to save his endangered brother.",
    "summary_short": "After walking away from a legendary MMA career to become a commercial fisherman, Patton James is forced back into the cage when his brother's life is put in jeopardy. To prepare for the dangerous stakes ahead, Patton reunites with his estranged former coach, Sammy. Together, they embark on a rigorous training camp to prepare for a high-stakes showdown in ONE Championship. Patton must ultimately face off against Xavier Grau, a notoriously brutal and undefeated champion, in the ultimate fight for his family's survival.",
    "summary_long": "Patton James was once an absolute legend in the world of mixed martial arts, but he eventually walked away from the spotlight to pursue a quiet, grueling life as a commercial fisherman. His peaceful retirement is shattered when he receives news that his brother has fallen into severe danger, forcing Patton to make a desperate choice. Realizing that the only way to secure his brother's safety is through a massive financial payout, Patton agrees to return to professional fighting for one final match. He reaches out to Sammy, his old, hard-nosed coach, to help him regain the competitive edge he lost years ago. Sammy pushes Patton to his absolute limits, forcing him to confront both physical exhaustion and the mental demons that led to his initial retirement. The target of their preparation is a high-profile, high-stakes bout under the ONE Championship banner. Waiting for Patton in the cage is Xavier Grau, a terrifyingly brutal and highly dominant champion known for breaking his opponents. As fight night approaches, the tension escalates, turning the sporting event into a literal battle for life and death. In the roaring arena, Patton must summon every ounce of his past greatness to survive Grau's onslaught and rescue his family.",
    "synopsis": "Beast follows the emotional and action-packed journey of Patton James, a retired mixed martial arts icon who has traded the roar of the arena for the solitude of commercial fishing. When family tragedy strikes and his brother's life hangs in the balance, Patton is forced out of retirement for a high-stakes return to the cage. Reuniting with his long-time trainer Sammy, Patton must endure an intense training camp to prepare for a final bout in ONE Championship. To save his brother, he will have to defeat Xavier Grau, a ruthless and seemingly unstoppable champion. This gripping sports drama explores the lengths a man will go to protect his family, culminating in a brutal, must-win clash of titans.",
